SIT-LMPC Remastered derives its racecar implementation from BRO-LMPC and
SIT-LMPC/TWIT_LMPC by Zirui Zang (zzangupenn).
The inherited Apache-2.0 license is retained in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt;
the upstream notice is retained verbatim in NOTICE.upstream. The repository's
original MIT license remains in LICENSE.

Source revisions, relevant working-file hashes and copied dependency files
are recorded in docs/MIGRATION_SOURCE_MANIFEST.json. Vendor packages retain
their respective licenses and notices. No original repositories are modified.

The BNN population learner and coherent sampler are provided by the vendored
dyna-dist snapshot. F1TENTH provides the ST simulator; utilitySuite provides
optional Qt plotting. Generated models, datasets and experiment outputs are runtime artifacts,
excluded from Git. The curated examples/racecar directory intentionally includes
one small pretrained population model and selected numeric validation data.
